---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE_NAME } from '../config/site';

const updated = '7 November 2026';
---

<BaseLayout title="Terms" description={`The terms for using ${SITE_NAME}.`}>
  <div class="container prose">
    <p class="draft" role="note">
      <strong>Draft for review.</strong> These terms are a plain first draft. Please review and have
      them checked before launch, including the governing-law section.
    </p>

    <h1>Terms of use</h1>
    <p class="prose__meta">Last updated: {updated}</p>

    <h2>Using the arcade</h2>
    <p>
      {SITE_NAME} is free to play for personal entertainment. By using the site you agree to these
      terms. If you don't agree, please don't use the site.
    </p>

    <h2>Our content</h2>
    <p>
      The games, their names, art, sounds and code are original and owned by {SITE_NAME} unless noted
      otherwise. Any third-party fonts or assets are used under their own permissive licences. Please
      don't copy, redistribute or republish the games or their assets without permission.
    </p>

    <h2>Your saved data</h2>
    <p>
      Scores, preferences and streaks are stored in your browser on your device. They can be lost if
      you clear your browser data, use a different device, or switch browsers. {SITE_NAME} can't
      recover local data.
    </p>

    <h2>Fair play (when leaderboards arrive)</h2>
    <p>
      Global leaderboards are planned. When they launch, you'll be asked to pick a display name.
      Choose something appropriate — names that are offensive or impersonate others may be removed.
      Don't tamper with scores or try to submit results you didn't earn; suspicious entries may be
      rejected or removed.
    </p>

    <h2>Ads (when enabled)</h2>
    <p>
      {SITE_NAME} may show ads in future. Ads will never cover the game screen or touch controls
      during play. See the <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}privacy`}>privacy page</a> for how ad
      providers handle data.
    </p>

    <h2>No warranty</h2>
    <p>
      The site is provided "as is", without warranties of any kind. It may have bugs, change, or be
      unavailable at times. To the extent allowed by law, {SITE_NAME} isn't liable for any loss
      arising from using the site.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>
      These terms may change as the site grows. The date above shows the latest version.
    </p>

    <h2>Governing law</h2>
    <p>
      To be confirmed before launch (expected: Singapore). This placeholder is part of the draft.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .prose {
    padding-top: var(--sp-6);
    max-width: 720px;
  }
  .prose h2 {
    margin-top: var(--sp-6);
  }
  .prose__meta {
    color: var(--ticket-dim);
    font-size: var(--fs-0);
  }
  .draft {
    padding: var(--sp-3) var(--sp-4);
    border: 1px solid var(--marquee);
    border-radius: var(--r-button);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--marquee) 10%, transparent);
    color: var(--ticket);
  }
</style>
